# Grievous Wound: "Whenever enchanted player is dealt damage, they lose half their life, rounded up." (CR 120.2, 603.2). Bot1 enchants
# Bot2 on turn 1. On turn 3 a Lightning Bolt at Bot1 itself (not enchanted) changes only its life (17), the control. A second
# Bolt at Bot2 (not combat damage) leaves it at 17, then the trigger resolves after the damage (ruling 2024-09-20): half of 17
# rounded up is 9, leaving 8.

